# The HL7 Da Vinci CRD reference server that the crd-reference CI job runs the
# workbench against (scripts/crd-reference-server.sh, scripts/reference-runs.mjs).
# Both commits are pinned so an upstream break can't turn CI red: the server's own
# build clones CDS-Library at master unless told otherwise.
#
# To bump: pick a commit from https://github.com/HL7-DaVinci/CRD/commits/master and
# one from https://github.com/HL7-DaVinci/CDS-Library/commits/master, set them here,
# then run `bash scripts/crd-reference-server.sh start` and
# `node --test scripts/reference-runs.mjs` against a running workbench (AGENTS.md).
# The image tag and the CI cache key both come from this file, so a bump rebuilds.
CRD_COMMIT=43547c4e69052df4d3532972e4bd03f8d5317d13
CDS_LIBRARY_COMMIT=560403a97a4c50248713fad90314faaeeff7977d
